    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010410/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1705571651\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010410/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1705571651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010410/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1705571651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010410/extras/0dcc925e9deae9b6ac5b1012aca635ba.avif?t=1705571651\" /></div><br><strong>Psyolence</strong> sounds like an exciting and adrenaline-pumping arcade game with a unique blend of cyberpunk aesthetics and fast-paced action. As the player, you'll wield a katana in a top-down perspective and engage in intense slashing combat against hordes of enemies in a virtual cyberspace environment. The game's neon graphics will create a visually stunning and immersive experience, complementing the intense gameplay.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010410/extras/0be18bc5201258b2486492e59bc2b907.poster.avif?t=1705571651\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010410/extras/0be18bc5201258b2486492e59bc2b907.webm?t=1705571651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010410/extras/0be18bc5201258b2486492e59bc2b907.mp4?t=1705571651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Neon Cyberpunk Aesthetics: Psyolence features captivating neon graphics that immerse players in a vibrant and futuristic cyberpunk world. The visually striking environment adds to the game's immersive experience.<br></li><li>Hardcore Top-Down Slasher Gameplay: Players take on the role of a katana-wielding warrior, engaging in fast-paced and challenging combat against waves of enemies. Precise timing and swift reflexes are essential to survive and advance.<br></li><li>Intense Action and Speed: The game's fast-paced action keeps players on their toes, demanding quick decision-making and swift movements to evade enemy attacks and deliver lethal blows.<br></li><li>15 Levels of Intensity: Psyolence offers a substantial journey through 15 levels of escalating difficulty. Each level introduces new challenges and enemy types, pushing players to their limits as they progress.<br></li><li>Epic Boss Battles: As the ultimate test of skill, players must face and defeat powerful bosses at the end of their journey. These epic encounters require strategy and mastery of combat mechanics, providing a thrilling climax to the gameplay.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010410/extras/d62050c40a5eea0481ce4b5f9e267fb9.poster.avif?t=1705571651\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010410/extras/d62050c40a5eea0481ce4b5f9e267fb9.webm?t=1705571651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010410/extras/d62050c40a5eea0481ce4b5f9e267fb9.mp4?t=1705571651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
